ENRICH {"name": "highway", "prose": "An endless stretch of black asphalt cutting through nothing. The sky is that weird bruised purple right before the sun comes up. No cars, no movement, just a single rusted billboard flapping in the wind. It feels lonely, like the edge of the world.", "elements": [{"role": "text", "text": "an endless stretch of black asphalt", "origin": "invented", "invented": [[0, 35]], "id": "subject"}, {"role": "text", "text": "a bruised purple sky", "origin": "invented", "invented": [[0, 20]], "id": "sky"}, {"role": "text", "text": "a single rusted billboard flapping in the wind", "origin": "invented", "invented": [[0, 46]], "id": "billboard"}, {"role": "text", "text": "the asphalt extends into the sky, where the billboard is anchored at the edge, its surface slightly streaked with wind-blown dust", "origin": "invented", "invented": [[0, 129]], "id": "relation"}, {"role": "text", "text": "the scene feels lonely, like the edge of the world", "origin": "invented", "invented": [[0, 50]], "id": "feeling"}], "compiled": "an endless stretch of black asphalt, a bruised purple sky, a single rusted billboard flapping in the wind, the asphalt extends into the sky, where the billboard is anchored at the edge, its surface slightly streaked with wind-blown dust, the scene feels lonely, like the edge of the world.", "verdict": null, "typed_chars": 248, "out_chars": 289}
ENRICH {"name": "kitchen", "prose": "A completely silent apartment kitchen in the middle of a hot afternoon. The dust motes are just hanging in the air where the sun hits the linoleum floor. A half-empty glass of water is sitting on the counter, sweating. It feels like someone just left the room in a hurry.", "elements": [{"role": "text", "text": "a completely silent apartment kitchen", "origin": "invented", "invented": [[0, 37]], "id": "subject"}, {"role": "text", "text": "sunlight hitting the linoleum floor", "origin": "invented", "invented": [[0, 35]], "id": "light"}, {"role": "text", "text": "dust motes suspended in the air where sunlight hits the linoleum floor", "origin": "invented", "invented": [[0, 70]], "id": "dust"}, {"role": "text", "text": "a half-empty glass of water on the counter", "origin": "invented", "invented": [[0, 42]], "id": "object"}, {"role": "text", "text": "the glass is sweating", "origin": "invented", "invented": [[0, 21]], "id": "object-state"}, {"role": "text", "text": "the room feels still and slightly unsettled, as if someone just left in a hurry", "origin": "invented", "invented": [[0, 79]], "id": "atmosphere"}], "compiled": "a completely silent apartment kitchen, sunlight hitting the linoleum floor, dust motes suspended in the air where sunlight hits the linoleum floor, a half-empty glass of water on the counter, the glass is sweating, the room feels still and slightly unsettled, as if someone just left in a hurry.", "verdict": null, "typed_chars": 271, "out_chars": 295}
ENRICH {"name": "blurred-man", "prose": "I saw a guy standing under a streetlamp across the wet pavement. He had a heavy coat on, collar turned up against the mist. I couldn't see his face at all, just the glow from his cigarette lighting up the smoke around his head. He was just watching the dark windows of the house next to me.", "elements": [{"role": "text", "text": "a man standing under a streetlamp across the wet pavement", "origin": "invented", "invented": [[0, 57]], "id": "subject"}, {"role": "text", "text": "a heavy coat, collar turned up against the mist", "origin": "invented", "invented": [[0, 47]], "id": "garment"}, {"role": "text", "text": "face not visible", "origin": "invented", "invented": [[0, 16]], "id": "face"}, {"role": "text", "text": "cigarette glow lighting up the smoke around his head", "origin": "invented", "invented": [[0, 52]], "id": "lighting"}, {"role": "text", "text": "watching the dark windows of the house next to me", "origin": "invented", "invented": [[0, 49]], "id": "gaze"}], "compiled": "a man standing under a streetlamp across the wet pavement, a heavy coat, collar turned up against the mist, face not visible, cigarette glow lighting up the smoke around his head, watching the dark windows of the house next to me.", "verdict": null, "typed_chars": 290, "out_chars": 230}
