ENRICH {"name": "bird", "prose": "There was this bird sitting on a concrete ledge, but when it tilted its head, I heard gears clicking. It had feathers, but they looked like they were made of tarnished silver or tin. It just stared at me with these glassy, static black eyes while the sky behind it turned a dark, smoky orange.", "elements": [{"role": "text", "text": "a bird sitting on a concrete ledge", "origin": "invented", "invented": [[0, 34]], "id": "subject"}, {"role": "text", "text": "when it tilted its head, I heard gears clicking", "origin": "invented", "invented": [[0, 47]], "id": "action"}, {"role": "text", "text": "feathers that look like tarnished silver or tin", "origin": "invented", "invented": [[0, 47]], "id": "feathers"}, {"role": "text", "text": "glassy, static black eyes", "origin": "invented", "invented": [[0, 25]], "id": "eyes"}, {"role": "text", "text": "sky behind the bird turning a dark, smoky orange", "origin": "invented", "invented": [[0, 48]], "id": "sky"}], "compiled": "a bird sitting on a concrete ledge, when it tilted its head, I heard gears clicking, feathers that look like tarnished silver or tin, glassy, static black eyes, sky behind the bird turning a dark, smoky orange.", "verdict": null, "typed_chars": 293, "out_chars": 210}
