ENRICH {"name": "hand", "prose": "We were walking through a regular forest, but suddenly the trees cleared and there was this colossal stone hand bursting out of the dirt. Just the hand, fingers reaching up like it was trying to grab the clouds. Moss was growing all over the knuckles. It felt ancient and terrifying.", "elements": [{"role": "text", "text": "a colossal stone hand", "origin": "derived", "id": "subject"}, {"role": "text", "text": "in a forest where the trees have cleared to reveal the hand", "origin": "derived", "id": "setting"}, {"role": "text", "text": "dappled sunlight filtering through the trees", "origin": "derived", "id": "light"}, {"role": "text", "text": "ancient and terrifying", "origin": "derived", "id": "atmosphere"}, {"role": "text", "text": "the hand stands centered in the clearing, fingers extended upward, shoulders and knuckles lit by the same dappled light, the surrounding trees forming a soft, encircling frame", "origin": "derived", "id": "relation"}], "compiled": "a colossal stone hand, in a forest where the trees have cleared to reveal the hand, dappled sunlight filtering through the trees, ancient and terrifying, the hand stands centered in the clearing, fingers extended upward, shoulders and knuckles lit by the same dappled light, the surrounding trees forming a soft, encircling frame.", "verdict": null, "typed_chars": 283, "out_chars": 330}
